    <h2>Changes and ending</h2>
    <p>We may update these terms; the date at the top shows the latest version. You can stop using Shift at any time by signing out and deleting the app.</p>

    <h2>Law</h2>
    <p>These terms are governed by the laws of New South Wales, Australia.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p><a href="mailto:hello@getshiftmail.com">hello@getshiftmail.com</a></p>
  </main>
</Base>
